  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of the Global Fund Steering Committee (GFSC) Operations Through IOM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Fund (GF) is a partnership designed to accelerate the end of HIV/AIDS, tuberculosis and malaria as epidemics. The proposed project will provide financial assistance to support; human resource costs i.e. salaries for the GFSC secretariat (1 staff), performance of the GFSC functions (quarterly GFSC meetings and oversight visits) and communication related support i.e. email and website maintenance.</narrative>
  </description>
